OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Aattempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder following an incident
OL,8,Fin Plymouth.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to the North Hill area of
OL,12,Fthe city at about 19:20 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe force said it was reported a man
OL,15,Fhad sustained life-changing injuries
OL,16,Fand was taken to hospital.
