OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder, assault
OL,8,Foccasioning grievous bodily harm and
OL,9,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,10,Fpublic place, police said. He remains
OL,11,Fin police custody.
